WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:06.107
This draft breaks my style guide on purpose. Let's see what the workbench does with it.

2
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:12.621
Every red underline in the source is something to fix. Select Check to see them all.

3
00:00:13.133 --> 00:00:19.467
The check names the rule behind each finding, says why it matters, and shows the fix.

4
00:00:19.967 --> 00:00:24.551
One fix rewrites one line of the source, and nothing else.

5
00:00:25.067 --> 00:00:29.651
Or take every fix at once. The draft now passes.

6
00:00:30.167 --> 00:00:36.815
The same code checks every document in my library, so what you read here passed the same test.

7
00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:43.791
Write a document yourself, and watch it get checked, at karandeshmukh dot dev slash workbench.
